# Never bake secrets or dev artifacts into the image
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.bak
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.crt

# Dev artifacts
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/logs
**/*.log
backend/public
backend/.env.bak
.git
.gitignore
.claude
.vscode
.idea

# Docs & misc (not needed at runtime)
*.md
LICENSE
